A||||13||Songman||Doug and the Fiero Warehouse||||1||
Z||000000||Songman||02-21-2001||10:07 AM||||I spent part of the day yesterday with Doug at the Fiero Warehouse. When I foud out I was going to be in Pittsburgh, my first thought was to find out how close he was...<BR>It was definitely worth the little side trip.<P>Of course, I got to see and drive the Indy that he will be delivering to me in a couple of weeks, but I also enjoyed seeing all of his cars. I'm looking forward to seeing that pearl T-top GT all put together and looking good in Daytona soon.<P>The only bad thing about going there was realizing that I didn't have enough money to buy everything that I wanted!<P>Thanks Doug! I enjoyed the visit.<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
