Z||000002||bHooper||02-21-2001||06:58 PM||||i heard you got to ride in "my" SE?  i am buying that car from him, so how was it?  ride good?<P>Doug is probably the <B>only</B> person that i would ever buy a car sight (well ok, he videotaped it) unseen from!<P>hoop||||reg||1
Z||000003||007DOUG||02-22-2001||12:49 AM||||Songman: I enjoyed our visit very much, wish we had more time. Though I have to admit, I cheated and visited your website before our visit. I'm glad you took the time to go out of your way for a visit. I had alot of fun<P>Hoop: I'm looking forward to your visit.<P>Sage, Reality, & Hank is Here have visited me, and I met-up with JMW in AL last Nov. Its always fun to finally meet forum members in person. Hope to meet alot more of you in FL<P>Doug||||reg||14
Z||000004||RossT||02-22-2001||12:58 AM||||Man, if only someone would just come to visit me!! I would be so happy. It gets lonely up here waiting for spring, with the fiero just collecting dust.<P>Come on... anyone!! the cold is only in your mind!!||||reg||1
Z||000005||MontanaFiero||02-22-2001||02:29 AM||||RossT wrote:<BR>  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR><BR>Come on... anyone!! the cold is only in your mind!!<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>BullS***!--  I just spent the afternoon under my SE undoing the engine cradle in my CARPORT. If it weren't for the heat from my halogen light my fingers would have fallen off.  <I>Actually, compared to what it was, 37 degrees seemed quite warm.</I><P>Those of you in the south... Up here we just learn to ACCEPT the cold. <p>[This message has been edited by MontanaFiero (edited 02-22-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000006||gabriel||02-22-2001||06:57 AM||||&gt;Those of you in the south... Up here we &gt;just learn to ACCEPT the cold<P>Hehe.  Down here its a frosty 80 degrees.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">   But I do miss snow ...||||reg||1
